Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:21.81,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}在只差一步時跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:25.48,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,以為到極限而消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.48,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,但我依然堅持前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:31.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不甘心就這樣結束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.24,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只要閉上雙眼想像
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.24,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(106,565,\blur2)\t(565,815,\blur0)}只要閉上{\alpha&HFF&}雙眼想像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:38.33,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能看見你在身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.24,0:01:38.33,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(66,400,\blur2)\t(400,858,\blur0)}總能看見{\alpha&HFF&}你在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:43.29,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,面帶我最愛的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.59,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:49.46,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.59,0:01:49.46,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(2980,3355,\blur3)\t(3355,3772,\blur0)}故事還在進行之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.88,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:55.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我們翻開下一頁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:59.10,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不用擔心我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:02.77,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只因心中時刻有你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.90,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.65,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,讓我變得更加堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:11.07,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,就算覺得堅持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:14.82,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,忍不住要流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.91,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,總能聽見你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:20.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,我一直都感覺良好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:23.83,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,絕對不會輕言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:30.00,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(5700,6180,\alpha&HC8&)}愛的力量多麼神奇
Comment: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.28,0:21:42.37,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)}就算身處遙遠又未知的星球
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.37,0:21:46.49,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,仰望著頭頂的那片陌生的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.49,0:21:50.46,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,就算深愛過的人和許下的諾言
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.46,0:21:53.71,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,還有其他的一切都不在手邊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:58.72,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1810,\alpha&H00&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.71,0:21:58.72,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我依然記憶猶新
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:01.84,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.72,0:22:01.84,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,時間之海默默記錄著你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:09.02,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(690,1840,\alpha&HFF&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.84,0:22:09.02,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,你輕輕推開了沉沒在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.14,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,那扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.85,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,0)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.85,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:16.94,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.85,0:22:16.94,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,在別人對我有所認知之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.24,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}我實際上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.24,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我實際上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:21.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1840)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.24,0:22:21.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.03,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,對自己有清楚的認知
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.03,0:22:27.41,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,獨自一人也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.20,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1810,0)\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}隨著季節更替
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.20,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,隨著季節更替
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:35.54,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}與互相擁抱取暖的某人相遇又離別
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.20,0:22:35.54,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,與互相擁抱取暖的某人相遇又離別
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:43.68,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}偶爾流下的淚水被月光照亮
